msgid ""
"Moving to a four-dimensional data vector $\\vec{x} = (\\vec{x}_1, "
"\\vec{x}_2, \\vec{x}_3, \\vec{x}_4)$ and mapping to a four-qubit ZZFM with "
"one repetition, we can start to see the mapping $\\phi$ for various qubit "
