# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit provides a parameter, $\\alpha$, in Pauli feature maps to control the"
" scaling of Pauli rotations.\n"
msgstr ""
"Qiskit fournit un paramètre, $\\alpha$, dans les feature maps de Pauli pour "
"contrôler l'échelle des rotations de Pauli.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"U(\\bar{x}) = \\exp\\left(i \\alpha \\sum_{S\\subseteq[n]} \\phi_S(\\bar{x}) \\prod_{i \\in S} \\sigma_i \\right)\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"U(\\bar{x}) = \\exp\\left(i \\alpha \\sum_{S\\subseteq[n]} \\phi_S(\\bar{x}) \\prod_{i \\in S} \\sigma_i \\right)\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The default value of $\\alpha$ is $2$. By optimizing its value in the "
"interval, for example, $[0,4],$ one can better align a quantum kernel to the"
" data.\n"
msgstr ""
"La valeur par défaut de $\\alpha$ est $2$. En optimisant sa valeur dans "
"l'intervalle, par exemple, $[0,4],$ on peut mieux aligner un noyau quantique"
" aux données.\n"

